0	section	Using the zombie head on Dr Fenkenstrain
1	line	Player	I have a winner for you here, Doctor! Look! It's still moving!
1	line	Zombie Head	Nobody knows the troubles I've seen...nobody knows my sorrow...
1	line	Dr Fenkenstrain	I can't use that head!
1	line	Player	Why not?
1	line	Dr Fenkenstrain	If that thing keeps wriggling around, I'll never get the stitches straight.
1	line	Dr Fenkenstrain	...And who knows what problems will come up if we have an undead head on a truly dead body.
1	line	Dr Fenkenstrain	Bring me another head, one that isn't still movingno period
1	action	end
