1	line	Dr Fenkenstrain	Where are my needle and thread, {player}?
1	cond	If the player does not have either the needle or five thread:
2	action	end
1	cond	If the player has a costume needle:
2	action	end
1	cond	If the player only has a needle in their inventory:
2	line	Dr Fenkenstrain	Ah, a needle. Wonderful.
2	action	end
1	cond	If the player only has 1-5 thread in their inventory:
2	line	Dr Fenkenstrain	Some thread, excellent.
2	action	end
1	cond	If the player only brought the needle and speaks to him again:
2	line	Dr Fenkenstrain	Where's my thread, {player}?
2	action	end
1	cond	If the player only brought the thread and speaks to him again:
2	line	Dr Fenkenstrain	Where's my needle, {player}?
2	action	end
1	cond	If the player brought the needle and five thread to Dr Fenkenstrain:
2	box	Fenkenstrain uses the needle and thread to sew the body parts together. Soon, a hideous creature lies inanimate on the ritual table.
2	line	Dr Fenkenstrain	Perfect. But I need one more thing from you - flesh and bones by themselves do not make life.
2	line	Player	Really?
2	line	Dr Fenkenstrain	I have honed to perfection an ancient ritual that will give life to this creature, but for this I must harness the very power of Nature.
2	line	Player	And what power is this?
2	line	Dr Fenkenstrain	The power of lightning.
2	line	Player	Sorry, can't make lightning, you've got the wrong man-
2	line	Dr Fenkenstrain	Silence your insolent tongue! The storm that brews overhead will create the lightning. What I need you to do is to repair the lightning conductor on the balcony above.
2	line	Player	Repair the lightning conductor, right. Can I have a break, soon? By law I'm entitled to 15 minutes every-
2	line	Dr Fenkenstrain	Repair the conductor and BEGONE!!!
2	action	end
0	section	Talking to Dr Fenkenstrain again after sewing the body parts together
1	line	Player	How do I repair the lightning conductor?
1	line	Dr Fenkenstrain	Oh, it would be easier to do it myself! If you find a conductor mould you should be able to cast a new one.
1	line	Dr Fenkenstrain	Remember this, {player}: my experiment will only work with a conductor made from silver.
1	action	end
