2	action	
2	action	end
1	option	Do you know where a conductor mould is?
2	line	Player	Do you know where I can find a lightning conductor mould?
2	line	Gardener Ghost	A conductive mould, you say? Let me see-
2	line	Gardener Ghost	There used to be a bloke 'ere, sort of an 'andyman e was. Did everything round the place - fixed what was broke, swept the chimneys and the like. He would 'ave had a mould, I imagine.
2	line	Player	Where is he now?
2	line	Gardener Ghost	E's dead, just like everyone else round 'ere ... 'cept for me.
2	action	end
1	option	What happened to your head?
2	action	above
